      "content": "that makes sense. i'm seeing a lot of these scattered, irregular bits in this specific trench, though. sometimes the color is really inconsistent across a single shard. does that suggest the kiln temperature was unstable, or could there be other factors like the clay composition or even post-depositional factors affecting the oxidation?",
